// expect-error: E3144
// A `#[...]` list can name every attribute at once. Each entry is validated
// against the following declaration; the last one must not be silently
// dropped. Here `error_code` is the 8th (and final) entry and is invalid on a
// function, so it must still produce E3144.

#[strict, flags, json, discard, test, deprecated("old"), doc, error_code]
do something() {
}

do main() {
    something()
}
